§ `s 84A(1)`

#ASSERT `the threshold percent` `an 8-year-old condo at 85%` EQUALS 90
#ASSERT `the threshold percent` `an 8-year-old condo at 90%` EQUALS 90
#ASSERT `the threshold percent` `a 25-year-old condo at 80%` EQUALS 80
#ASSERT `the threshold percent` `a 25-year-old condo at 85% share value but 78% area` EQUALS 80
#ASSERT `the threshold percent` `a condo exactly 10 years old at 80%` EQUALS 80

#ASSERT NOT `the majority may apply for a collective sale` `an 8-year-old condo at 85%`
#ASSERT `the majority may apply for a collective sale` `an 8-year-old condo at 90%`
#ASSERT `the majority may apply for a collective sale` `a 25-year-old condo at 80%`
#ASSERT NOT `the majority may apply for a collective sale` `a 25-year-old condo at 85% share value but 78% area`
#ASSERT `the majority may apply for a collective sale` `a condo exactly 10 years old at 80%`

